# 5W1H
Use 5W1H to establish the basic context of the penetration test before testing begins.

## What
What is being tested?
```text
Target:
System:
Application:
Services:
```

## Why
Why is the penetration test being performed?
```text
Purpose:
Objectives:
```

## Who
Who is involved in the penetration test?
```text
Client:
System Owner:
Tester:
Technical Contact:
Emergency Contact:
```

## Where
Where will the testing take place?
```text
Target Environment:
Network:
Location:
```

## When
When will the penetration test be performed?
```text
Start:
End:
Allowed Hours:
```

## How
How will the penetration test be conducted?
```text
Testing Type:
Testing Methodology:
Allowed Techniques:
Restrictions:
```
